    <section class="content-section">
      <h2>Connected research ecosystem</h2>

      <p>
        Wood-Chip Monitor is the deployment layer of a broader research
        program. UOT-DETR provides the distributionally constrained geometry
        engine, the WoodChip-Detection dataset supports dense detection and
        measurement research, and MoistNetLite supplies the lightweight
        moisture component. The public repository preserves the application,
        model definitions, validation records, deployment documentation, and
        hardware CAD files.
      </p>

